        {
          "text": "Alimwi aletele Jehova cipaizyo cakwe candubyo: mugutu uutakwe kampenda wakumatanga aakwe, mbubonya mbuli muulo ngobikide. Alete cipaizyo kumupaizi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
