          "text": "Nceeci cipaizyo ca-Aroni abana bakwe, ncibeelede kuletela Jehova mubuzuba bwakunanikwa kwabo: cipanzi cakumi cacisuwo cabusu bunante, cibe cipaizyo cabusu calyoonse. Cisela caco cituulwe cifumo, acisela cimwi mangolezya. ",
